  "description": "Precipitates formed but no banding.",
  "body_html": "<p>In my <a href=\"https://chillphysicsenjoyer.substack.com/p/liesegang-rings\">last post</a> I wrote about my experiment to create Liesegang rings. There, I tried to create geometrically spaced rings with an agar jelly mixed with magnesium chloride hexahydrate, soaked with sodium hydroxide. </p><p>I was trying to follow the procedure in Chopard 1999 - the difference is that I used agar jelly instead of the cross-linked PVA paper that they used in the paper. Otherwise, the concentrations of magnesium chloride and sodium hydroxide were kept the same. (Note - I didn't say the difference between agar and PVA in the last post, and it will be updated accordingly, this is my bad).</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png\" width=\"728\" height=\"409.5\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:false,&quot;imageSize&quot;:&quot;normal&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:728,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;captionedImage&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!LCJQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F39dc8d47-cea0-401c-88ea-f682a9e3cb15_540x362.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>In the spirit of transparency, I wanted to show the results of the experiment after 9 days of leaving it in my house in open air. To the best of my knowledge the temperature ranged from around 20C to 25C.</p><p>In the images below, you can see the precipitate forming, but it doesn't form clean bands like in the Chopard 1999 paper. The precipitate is concentrated at the top, and seems to get more dispersed towards the bottom - but there is no clear separation of bands. So something is happening, but it's not the effect I want. Also, the density of the precipitate seemed to vary in the two tubes</p><p>I'm keeping the third tube undisturbed right now - I'm not even picking it up to take a photo. Will see what happens.</p><p>Test tube 1:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DVfm!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8e5d780-9f3c-4700-a1e1-7cbfb788d900_2519x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DVfm!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8e5d780-9f3c-4700-a1e1-7cbfb788d900_2519x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DVfm!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8e5d780-9f3c-4700-a1e1-7cbfb788d900_2519x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DVfm!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8e5d780-9f3c-4700-a1e1-7cbfb788d900_2519x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DVfm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8e5d780-9f3c-4700-a1e1-7cbfb788d900_2519x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DVfm!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb8e5d780-9f3c-4700-a1e1-7cbfb788d900_2519x3024.jpeg\" width=\"728\" height=\"409.5\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b8e5d780-9f3c-4700-a1e1-7cbfb788d900_2